			"notes": "## 🆕 What's New\n\n### 📖 Guide Book\n- New **Guide Book** item given on first join alongside Blank Plasmid\n- 16-page bilingual (EN/ZH) interactive guide with page-flipping\n- Right-click to open — no more confusion for new players!\n- Craftable: Book + Blank Plasmid → Guide Book (×1)\n\n### 📝 Revised Guide Content\n- Every recipe now shows exact quantities (×1, ×4, ×8)\n- Mob→CDS drop table with all 8 mob/gene pairs\n- Plasmid Assembler GUI layout as ASCII diagram\n- All 7 bio-enhancement tiers with specific numbers\n- Split across 16 focused pages (up from 12) so nothing gets cut off\n\n### 🛠 Starter Kit Upgrade\n- IgemMod.java: now gives Guide Book + Blank Plasmid on join\n- Each checked independently — lose one, get it back on rejoin\n- All synbio recipes auto-unlocked as before\n\n### 🔧 Other\n- Bump to v1.2.0\n- Deleted stale models/item/plasmid_assembler.json"
		},
